{"4504510": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Great Exhibition", "steam_appid": 4504510, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Great Exhibition</strong> is searching for its next curator. The job requires you to venture into lost temples to acquire the greatest collection of ancient artifacts for the museum. Keep growing the collection, increase our prestige, and descend ever deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delve into Lost Temples</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you venture into long forgotten tombs of old. The path to greatness is blocked by countless lethal traps and mind-bending puzzles. Become an expert archaeologist and find your Magnum Opus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/aed3f21fc0eb98a99bd48e2e284a6fcc.poster.avif?t=1785067644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/aed3f21fc0eb98a99bd48e2e284a6fcc.webm?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/aed3f21fc0eb98a99bd48e2e284a6fcc.mp4?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Curate the Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you manage the collection. Arranging the displays in the most prestigious way. Gather sets of artifacts to boost their value and attract the attention of world renowned explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/e4dd086024eb5c5a35aa20fd8050cb16.poster.avif?t=1785067644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/e4dd086024eb5c5a35aa20fd8050cb16.webm?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/e4dd086024eb5c5a35aa20fd8050cb16.mp4?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture ever Deeper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you venture ever deeper into the tombs. Purchase specialized equipment and finance expeditions to unexplored lands. A good memory will suit you well as all tombs are connected in more ways than you imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/b2f390e8c5bcd7a0a2eab301439bcc0c.poster.avif?t=1785067644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/b2f390e8c5bcd7a0a2eab301439bcc0c.webm?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/b2f390e8c5bcd7a0a2eab301439bcc0c.mp4?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attract the World’s Attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, all eyes are on you! Sway the experts and gain access to the most prestigious archaeologist clubs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you are in charge of the narrative. What stories underpin these civilizations? What ties them all together? The artifacts are like pages in a book, what does their ending mean for us? And above all... what happened to Mr. Silas Vane?</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Great Exhibition</strong> is searching for its next curator. The job requires you to venture into lost temples to acquire the greatest collection of ancient artifacts for the museum. Keep growing the collection, increase our prestige, and descend ever deeper.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Delve into Lost Temples</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you venture into long forgotten tombs of old. The path to greatness is blocked by countless lethal traps and mind-bending puzzles. Become an expert archaeologist and find your Magnum Opus. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/aed3f21fc0eb98a99bd48e2e284a6fcc.poster.avif?t=1785067644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/aed3f21fc0eb98a99bd48e2e284a6fcc.webm?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/aed3f21fc0eb98a99bd48e2e284a6fcc.mp4?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Curate the Collection</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you manage the collection. Arranging the displays in the most prestigious way. Gather sets of artifacts to boost their value and attract the attention of world renowned explorers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/e4dd086024eb5c5a35aa20fd8050cb16.poster.avif?t=1785067644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/e4dd086024eb5c5a35aa20fd8050cb16.webm?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/e4dd086024eb5c5a35aa20fd8050cb16.mp4?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Venture ever Deeper</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you venture ever deeper into the tombs. Purchase specialized equipment and finance expeditions to unexplored lands. A good memory will suit you well as all tombs are connected in more ways than you imagine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/b2f390e8c5bcd7a0a2eab301439bcc0c.poster.avif?t=1785067644\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/b2f390e8c5bcd7a0a2eab301439bcc0c.webm?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4504510/extras/b2f390e8c5bcd7a0a2eab301439bcc0c.mp4?t=1785067644\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Attract the World’s Attention</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, all eyes are on you! Sway the experts and gain access to the most prestigious archaeologist clubs.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mysteries</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the head curator, you are in charge of the narrative. What stories underpin these civilizations? What ties them all together? The artifacts are like pages in a book, what does their ending mean for us? And above all... what happened to Mr. Silas Vane?</p>", "short_description": "You are the head curator of a museum. Gather ancient artifacts to expand your collection by raiding temples of long-lost civilizations.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Bulgarian, Czech, Danish, Dutch, Finnish, Greek, Hungarian, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Norwegian, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Romanian, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin